## 6. Chosen process: PFD and 1 t/day mass balance

### Process description (high level)
- Feedstock: 1,000 kg/day dry biomass (agro‑residue). Pretreatment (steam explosion or dilute acid) to improve cellulose accessibility. Slurry to ~10 wt% solids is prepared. Slurry mixed with biphasic solvent (GVL) and fed to continuous packed‑bed solid‑acid reactor operated at ~190 °C and ~12 bar for liquid phase operation (residence time ~30 min). Reactor outlet goes to hot phase separator (decanter/centrifuge) that splits organic (GVL + LA) and aqueous (water + formic acid). Organic phase goes to solvent recovery (distillation), recycled solvent returns to feed, and LA concentrated/polished for storage. Aqueous phase undergoes acid recovery/neutralization and wastewater treatment. Catalyst regeneration handles humins via periodic solvent wash and thermal oxidation.

### Embedded process flow diagram
(Place the SVG in the document to display the diagram)

![Pilot PFD — Continuous Biphasic Solid‑Acid Process](process_flow.svg)

### Mass balance & assumptions (summary)
- Dry biomass: 1,000 kg/d, composition assumed cellulose 40% (400 kg cellulose).  
- Theoretical LA yield from cellulose: 0.644 g LA/g glucose → theoretical LA = 400 × 0.644 = 257.6 kg/d.  
- Assumed overall conversion efficiency (cellulose → LA) = 70% (pilot target) → LA ≈ 180.3 kg/d.  
- Formic acid (co‑product) mass ≈ 72 kg/d (mol ratio FA/LA mass ≈ 46/116).  
- Slurry solids: 10 wt% solids → slurry mass = 10,000 kg/d (water 9,000 kg/d).  
- Biphasic solvent (GVL) recycle: ~9,000 kg/d solvent inventory (makeup ~1% loss ≈ 90 kg/d).  
- Humin & solids to regeneration: ~200 kg/d (includes lignin, ash, humins).

Selected stream summary
- S-01 Biomass dry feed: 1,000 kg/d  
- S-02 Process water: 9,000 kg/d (slurry water)  
- S-03 Pretreated slurry: 10,000 kg/d  
- S-04 Solvent (GVL) recycle: 9,000 kg/d (makeup ~90 kg/d)  
- Product LA (organic phase): ≈ 181 kg/d  
- Formic acid (aqueous phase): ≈ 72 kg/d  
- Humins / solids: ~200 kg/d

Reactor sizing (pilot estimate)
- Feed total flow ≈ 19,000 kg/d ≈ 0.22 kg/s; for residence time 30 min (1800 s), required reactor volume ≈ 0.22 × 1800 ≈ 396 L → round to 400 L packed‑bed volume for pilot design.

